Hi Elena and Team,

During the automated analysis of Condition 4 (Spindle Speed S=800 rpm, Feed Rate F=35 mm/min, Depth of Cut D=0.25 mm), our DAQ monitoring system detected significant anomalies on the Vib_Spindle channel (accelerometer mounted on the spindle housing).

Key Observations:
- Anomaly score on Vib_Spindle reached 5.25, well above the 3.0σ baseline threshold.
- Dominant feature deviations include Kurtosis (+4.8σ) and Crest Factor (+3.9σ), indicating sharp impact-like vibration spikes rather than stationary cutting chatter.
- Table vibration (Vib_Table) and load cells remained within nominal tolerances.

Recommendation:
Please perform a physical inspection of the spindle bearing assembly and verify tool holder runout before proceeding with Condition 5 recordings.

